# Agent Task: Rate Limiting on /api/scan-now

Redis counter key hyh:scan-ratelimit:<YYYY-MM-DD> (string, incr). Max 10 manual scans per calendar day. On limit: return HTTP 429 with JSON { success: false, error: 'Rate limit reached', remaining: 0, resetAt: '<ISO date>' }. Implement in app/api/scan-now/route.ts using kv from @vercel/kv. Set TTL of 86400s on the counter key.

## Test requirements
Unit tests for: increment logic, block at limit (returns 429), reset at new day (different date key), remaining count in response.
